OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 40, dies in three-vehicle
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has died following a
OL,7,Fthree-vehicle collision in Lisburn.
OL,9,FShe was one of five people, including a
OL,10,Fchild, who were taken to hospital for
OL,11,Ftreatment after a crash on the Moira
OL,12,FRoad at the weekend.
OL,14,FKaren Stewart, 40, from Portadown in
OL,15,FCounty Armagh, later died in hospital
OL,16,Ffrom her injuries.
OL,18,FThe crash happened at about 11:06 BST
OL,19,Fon Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
